WEBVTT

00:07:57.873 --> 00:08:01.212
Por fatkeqesisht, pa gravitet,

00:08:01.212 --> 00:08:03.142
lotet nuk bien.

00:08:03.142 --> 00:08:06.166
Keshtu qe merr nje top gjithmone 
e me te madh apo cfaredo qe eshte

00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:08.174
te perzier me lotet e tu

00:08:08.174 --> 00:08:10.652
derisa rrjedhimisht, 
topi behet gjithmone e me i madh

00:08:10.652 --> 00:08:13.213
saqe tensioni i siperfaqjes e con ate 
drejt hundes tende

00:08:13.213 --> 00:08:14.947
si nje ujvare te vogel

00:08:14.947 --> 00:08:17.022
dhe shkon "drejt" ne syrin tjeter,

00:08:17.023 --> 00:08:20.490
dhe tani isha komplet i verbuar

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:23.588
jashte anijes kozmike.

00:08:23.588 --> 00:08:26.167
E pra, cila eshte gjeja me e frikshme 
qe keni bere ndonjehere?

00:08:26.167 --> 00:08:29.869
(Te qeshura)

00:08:29.869 --> 00:08:31.349
Ndoshta jane merimangat.